<section aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <h2 id="how-title">How one batch works</h2>
  <p>Batchelor is a fully onchain batch auction where everyone in a block gets the same price, and Monad's new page-based storage makes it cheap enough to clear every block.</p>
  <div class="panels">
    <article class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" role="img" aria-label="Collect: buy and sell orders enter the same block"><rect class="outline" x="65" y="15" width="130" height="120" rx="12"/>{#each [40,75,110] as y}<path class="bid-stroke" d={`M12 ${y}h70`} /><circle class="bid-fill" cx="110" cy={y} r="8"/><path class="ask-stroke" d={`M248 ${y}h-70`} /><circle class="ask-fill" cx="150" cy={y} r="8"/>{/each}</svg><h3>Collect</h3><p>Buy and sell limits enter one block.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" role="img" aria-label="Seal: the next block closes the batch to new orders"><rect class="outline" x="45" y="15" width="170" height="120" rx="12"/>{#each [45,75,105] as y}<circle class="bid-fill" cx="80" cy={y} r="8"/><circle class="ask-fill" cx="110" cy={y} r="8"/>{/each}<rect class="clear-fill" x="148" y="65" width="42" height="36" rx="6"/><path class="clear-stroke" d="M157 65v-12a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v12"/></svg><h3>Seal</h3><p>The next block seals the orders together.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" role="img" aria-label="Clear: crossing demand and supply settle at one price"><path class="bid-stroke" d="M20 30h50v20h45v25h45v25h70"/><path class="ask-stroke" d="M20 120h50v-20h45v-25h45v-25h70"/><path class="clear-stroke" d="M20 75h210"/><circle class="clear-fill" cx="115" cy="75" r="6"/></svg><h3>Clear</h3><p>The next transaction clears at one price.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<style>section{margin-top:64px}section>p{color:var(--muted);max-width:850px}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:28px}svg{display:block;width:100%;margin-bottom:20px}.outline{fill:none;stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:2}.bid-stroke{stroke:var(--bid)}.ask-stroke{stroke:var(--ask)}.clear-stroke{stroke:var(--clear)}path{fill:none;stroke-width:3}.bid-fill{fill:var(--bid)}.ask-fill{fill:var(--ask)}.clear-fill{fill:var(--clear)}@media(max-width:768px){.panels{grid-template-columns:1fr}.panels svg{max-width:300px;margin:0 auto 20px}}</style>
